    "spec": "Return 'riskFlag' true when any of these hold: the owner is a possible duplicate, the email domain is disposable-adjacent, or the city is over its soft capacity; otherwise false.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nReturn 'riskFlag' true when any of these hold: the owner is a possible duplicate, the email domain is disposable-adjacent, or the city is over its soft capacity; otherwise false.\n"
